| Language | Best Time | Avg Time | Notes |
|----------|-----------|----------|-------|
| **Go**   | ~142 ms   | ~148 ms  | Compiled native binary |
| **Node.js** | ~385 ms | ~402 ms  | V8 JIT-compiled JS |

